{
  "$comment": [
    "Editorial romanization preferences for Russian-language source.",
    "",
    "This list exists mainly to hold one editorial position. When a Russian",
    "source names a Ukrainian place, the romanization of the Russian name is",
    "not what this archive publishes: Киев is rendered Kyiv, not Kiyev and not",
    "Kiev. The source said what it said and is preserved verbatim; the English",
    "rendering follows Ukrainian usage.",
    "",
    "Russian places keep their Russian-derived forms. The rule is about whose",
    "place it is, not about which language the sentence was written in.",
    "",
    "Field reference is identical to preferences.uk.json."
  ],
